WEBVTT

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:01.630
the opportunity
to walk into every encounter,

00:10:01.663 --> 00:10:03.997
like my dad walked off that plane,

00:10:03.997 --> 00:10:07.797
to choose curiosity over clash,

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:12.230
to expect development
of your ideas through discussion

00:10:12.263 --> 00:10:15.063
and to anchor in common purpose.

00:10:15.097 --> 00:10:18.163
That's what really
world-class persuaders do

00:10:18.163 --> 00:10:20.897
to build constructive conversations

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.697
and move them forward.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.463
It's how our world will move forward too.

00:10:25.463 --> 00:10:26.630
Thank you.